    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a tower defense game 65 million years in the making! Assemble a herd of unique dinosaurs to defend against an onslaught of invading insects.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the Terrain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dinos TD flips the tower defense genre on its head! You control the battlefield! Draw the paths your enemies walk on. Place Biome tiles to give your Dinos boons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/5db6473d9b85c2a4a886238572d23283.poster.avif?t=1745034473\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/5db6473d9b85c2a4a886238572d23283.webm?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/5db6473d9b85c2a4a886238572d23283.mp4?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dinosaurs! Dinosaurs! Dinosaurs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wide range of Dinosaurs each offering a new way to strategize and synergize with the environment and other dinos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/859e443d23ada30f40120726a533315a.poster.avif?t=1745034473\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/859e443d23ada30f40120726a533315a.webm?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/859e443d23ada30f40120726a533315a.mp4?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up each Dino to unlock flashy new abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/f3928e20afabfa1a93fe8a142bbeda0c.poster.avif?t=1745034473\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/f3928e20afabfa1a93fe8a142bbeda0c.webm?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/f3928e20afabfa1a93fe8a142bbeda0c.mp4?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avoid Extinction!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play around destructive world events like the meteor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/8648b65c394762420c78f96b44b10f07.poster.avif?t=1745034473\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/8648b65c394762420c78f96b44b10f07.webm?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/8648b65c394762420c78f96b44b10f07.mp4?t=1745034473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the master of dinosaurs in Dinos TD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533920/extras/d1a228166b284d9e823418e7088098f3.poster.avif?t=1745034473\" width=608 height=35